PRO FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION
WHEREAS the promoters desire to establish a limited partnership under the Limited Partnership Act of British Columbia to conduct multilingual customer inbound helpdesk and outbound tele-sales BPO services;
RESOLVED that [General Partner Name or Entity], acting as General Partner, is appointed with full power to manage partnership operations, enter contracts, and open bank accounts;
RESOLVED that the Limited Partnership Agreement be drafted, executed by all partners, and attached hereto, specifying capital contributions, profit sharing ratios, management authority of the General Partner, and limited liability protections for Limited Partners;
RESOLVED that the General Partner is authorized and directed to prepare and submit the Application for Registration of a Limited Partnership to the Registrar of Companies, British Columbia, together with all supporting documents including the executed Agreement and proof of identity;
RESOLVED that the registered office of the partnership shall be [Address], and any additional officers or authorized signatories be appointed as required for the proper conduct of BPO operations.
This resolution is passed unanimously and shall take immediate effect upon execution.
